      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“你猜我父亲怎么说。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Guess what my father said.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "千重子更使劲地摇晃着苗子的肩膀，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Chieko shook Naeko's shoulders even harder,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“他说，你去对苗子姑娘说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He said, go and tell Miss Naeko,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "要是她有什么苦恼或困难，就把她带到咱家来……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "if she has any troubles or difficulties, bring her to our house...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你是作为亲生女儿入了父亲户口的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You were entered in Father's family register as his own daughter.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不过对那姑娘也要尽量做到一视同仁，不分彼此呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But you must also treat that girl as equally as possible, without making any distinction between you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02183",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "千重子一个人太寂寞了吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Chieko must be far too lonely all by herself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
